WEBVTT

NOTE
The parade climax and sniper setup — a dramatic close-up of Sorceress Edea.
Duration: approximately 38 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.090
Close-up of a giant red digital clock displaying 19-59

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The final red digit flix, then snaps to 20-00

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Gears begin to turn, raising the circular platform

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The circular platform rises, revealing six holographic jesters materializing on it.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The platform rises into two tiers, holographic jesters above and holographic umbrella-holding bunnies below

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
The scene shifts to Edea’s throne, with the jester platform behind it and the digital clock in the distance.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Cyber-samurai parade dancers continue dancing in front of Edea’s throne.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Close-up of Sorceress Edea, her expression thoughtful and contemplative, as if sensing that something big is about to happen.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The throne moves toward and enters the triumphal gate.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
In a gear room atop the triumphal gate, Zell, Selphie, and Quistis stand ready.